{"id":"07a09ca243e6c6a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-surface.md","title":"Surface","display":"df-surface — Surface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-surface","aliases":["58-df-surface","Surface"],"display":"df-surface — Surface","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","[[58-df-plane-orientation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-surface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-surface</span><span>Surface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-surface — Surface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1bab78124334e27a\" href=\"?note=1bab78124334e27a\" title=\"58-df-plane-orientation.md\">58-df-plane-orientation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(S,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 使用依赖中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V\\)</span> 使用 58 内部平面绕数定义；它不是自由选择的谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Surface},\\operatorname{Orientable}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{Surface},\\operatorname{Orientable}\\subseteq V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Surface}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Surface}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}surface\\text{-}atlas}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(S,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2)\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,S,\\tau,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\forall\\langle U&#39;,W&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\left((\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap U&#39;]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}surface\\text{-}atlas}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(S,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(S,\\tau,2)\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,S,\\tau,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\forall\\langle U&#39;,W&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\left((\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap U&#39;]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}orientable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(S,\\tau,\\mathcal A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}orientable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Orientable}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(S,\\tau,\\mathcal A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原有一元谓词仍表达载体上存在相应的拓扑或定向图册，不将其擅自改成带拓扑参数的另一接口。</li>\n<li>需要讨论一个指定曲面拓扑时，使用三元的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\\)</span>，避免分别存在选择的拓扑互不相关。</li>\n<li>定向的数学内容全部在本文件和 58 内部依赖的前两节中给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>do Carmo, Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces</li>\n<li>Massey, A Basic Course in Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[